                "text": "Two years ago, I directed funding to the Medical College of Georgia to increase the amount of doctors in Middle & Southwest GA. Today, I met 4 students now training in Albany to discuss rural healthcare challenges they face & how Congress can help. https://t.co/vKKi3tqsgM",
