                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Today is #NationalRuralHealthDay! All Americans, regardless of ZIP code, deserve quality, affordable healthcare close to home. I\u2019m proud to secure funding for health clinics & programs across Middle & SW GA, including $6M to reopen the Randolph County hospital.",
