                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "This week, the bipartisan Congressional Peanut Caucus hosted its first \u201cNuts About the Farm Bill\u201d briefing. Members and staff were able to dive into topics like commodity support programs and crop insurance, guided by experts from the Congressional Research Service. As we continue to work on the Farm Bill, my caucus co-chair, Rep. Barry Moore of Alabama, and I will continue to help educate members about how the peanut industry is affected by this major authorization bill.",
