                "text": "The bill attacks Medicare, Medicaid, and the Affordable Care Act. It makes it harder for the most vulnerable to put food on the table. We need to fight fraud, waste, and abuse \u2013 not use those words as political cover for billionaire tax giveaways and ballooning the country\u2019s budget deficit.",
