                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "For 60 years, Medicare and Medicaid have helped ensure everyone has healthcare without crippling medical debt. Today, these programs cover more than 140 million Americans. Healthcare goes hand in hand with the ability to work and providing financial stability for your family and yourself as you age.\n\nWe need to protect these programs against bad actors and the draconian cuts this Administration is pushing so that they are most efficiently serving America\u2019s seniors, people with disabilities, children, new mothers, and low-income families.",
