                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Yesterday, we debated the federal funding bill that covers education, workforce, & healthcare. Drastic cuts, including those to Job Corps & the Centers for Disease Control, threaten our economy, undermine public safety, & make healthcare more expensive for Georgians.\nhttps://t.co/abpkm2XaDs",
